            "role": "S02_DIRECTIONS",
            "text": "Let study produce a visible working method: after learning a concept, record its rule, test it on a concrete case, and keep a short version that another person could follow. This gives \u5E9A\u6B63\u5370 and \u8F9B\u504F\u5370 a practical outlet while respecting the chart\u2019s Officer emphasis without claiming a predetermined sequence.\n\nBuild expression alongside absorption, not only after it. The natal chart has no Output\u2014neither \u98DF\u795E (Eating God) nor \u4F24\u5B98 (Hurting Officer)\u2014so explanations, demonstrations, and written summaries should be deliberately practised rather than treated as an innate chart feature. A peer review or paired exercise can make the hidden \u7678\u6BD4\u80A9 useful for both independent judgment and cooperation.\n\nWhen requirements conflict with personal pacing, separate the standard from the method: define what must be delivered, then choose the smallest reliable learning routine that serves it. This directly addresses the Day\u2013Hour \u620A\u7678\u5408 and the \u5348\u4E11 harms without turning them into a fixed developmental order.",
