            "text": "The current \u5927\u8FD0 is \u7532\u620C (Jia-Xu), ages 34\u201344. Its visible \u7532 is \u4F24\u5B98 (Hurting Officer), introducing an Output function that is absent from the natal chart; \u620C contains \u620A\u6B63\u5B98 (Direct Officer), \u8F9B\u504F\u5370 (Indirect Resource), and \u4E01\u504F\u8D22 (Indirect Wealth). This shifts the emphasis toward expressing, explaining, or reformulating what has been learned while still negotiating standards and methods. The Da Yun \u7532 also forms a confirmed \u7532\u5DF1 combination with the natal Year Stem \u5DF1\u4E03\u6740, without established transformation.\n\nThe 2026 \u4E19\u5348 year carries \u4E19\u6B63\u8D22 (Direct Wealth) on the Stem; \u5348 contains \u4E01\u504F\u8D22 (Indirect Wealth) and \u5DF1\u4E03\u6740 (Seven Killings). For this capability reading, \u8D22\u661F makes the practical use and tangible value of an output more visible, while \u5348 repeats the natal Month \u5348 and Hour \u5348, producing the confirmed annual \u5348\u5348 repetition/self-punishment relations; it also harms the natal Day-Branch \u4E11. This is a prompt to clarify how knowledge becomes useful and how requirements are arranged, not a prediction of grades, examinations, or credentials.",
