            "text": "Prioritise three conversions: turn knowledge into a repeatable method, turn practice into evidence that meets a stated standard, and turn emerging \u4F24\u5B98 expression into clear explanations with a defined practical use. Keep a modest space for independent judgment or collaboration, but do not substitute discussion for preparation. In the current \u7532\u620C Da Yun and \u4E19\u5348 year, review both the quality of the method and the usefulness of what it produces, while keeping demands and personal scheduling visibly separate.\n\nBaZi describes structural tendencies and changes across periods; practice, personal choices and real-world circumstances also shape learning and expression.",
